                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "Nib: The signature\npage refers to TWO\nfor the access\nright. THREE",
                                  "limits how that\nright may be used.\nThe clerk needs\nthe access page",
                                  "first, then its\nlimit. I could\nturn this into a\nspeech. I am",
                                  "choosing to turn\nit into a packet."
                                ],
